-- statement:
--   For any type $G$, simplex hypergraph $H$ on $n+1$ copies of $G$, and tuple $x$, the associated ordered pattern has an occurrence at $x$ if and only if, for every coordinate $j$, deleting $j$ from $x$ gives an edge of colour $j$ in $H$.
